  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Stance. For 30...78...90 seconds, you cannot be interrupted, but each time you would have been interrupted, you lose 10...5...4 Energy or Mantra of Resolve ends.",
      "zhTW": "持續 30～90 秒，使你的動作無法被中斷，但是每當敵人嘗試中斷你的動作時，你將會損失 10～4 能量或者意志頌歌的效果終止。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Stance. For 5 seconds, you cannot be interrupted, but each time you would have been interrupted, you lose 10...5...4 Energy or Mantra of Resolve ends.",
      "zhTW": "持續 5 秒，使你的動作無法被中斷，但是每當敵人嘗試中斷你的動作時，你將會損失 10～4 能量或者意志頌歌的效果終止。"
    }
